theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 60
text = "We are birds, and animals have always humiliated us.
 We pigeons, who helped humans deliver messages 
during World War II, are now being eaten by cats
because they see us as easy prey.
My brothers and sisters were eaten by cats and dogs.
 Even such strong birds as falcons are still seen as weak.
That’s why I decided to kill the lion, to strike a crushing blow
 against the animals, even though I am just a pigeon."

